WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,010 --> 00:00:02,410
so many years have passed

2
00:00:02,810 --> 00:00:04,410
The bureau's top researcher

3
00:00:04,410 --> 00:00:06,410
Exhausted all kinds of high-tech means

4
00:00:06,810 --> 00:00:09,010
I haven't even been able to figure out what he left behind back then.

5
00:00:09,410 --> 00:00:11,010
What the hell is this?

6
00:00:11,210 --> 00:00:12,810
Don't you want to know

7
00:00:13,210 --> 00:00:16,010
That bad old man who values money more than his life

8
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:18,800
Why did you come to the 749 Bureau back then?

9
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:20,200
Did you leave anything behind?

10
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:22,200
What did the old man leave behind?

11
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:24,440
This is it

12
00:00:26,060 --> 00:00:28,060
That depends on your confidentiality level.

13
00:00:28,750 --> 00:00:30,550
According to the rules of Bureau 749

14
00:00:30,750 --> 00:00:33,350
That thing is currently classified as an S-class secret.

15
00:00:33,750 --> 00:00:36,150
Stored in the deep vault of the General Administration

16
00:00:36,550 --> 00:00:37,950
your current identity

17
00:00:38,150 --> 00:00:40,950
Just an outsider still bargaining.

18
00:00:41,150 --> 00:00:44,150
Wait until you officially sign this special transport contract

19
00:00:44,350 --> 00:00:46,150
And make enough contributions

20
00:00:46,550 --> 00:00:48,150
Raise the confidentiality authority

21
00:00:48,550 --> 00:00:49,950
You are naturally qualified

22
00:00:49,950 --> 00:00:52,350
Go take a look at the handwriting your father left behind back then.
